<title>UK: Sullom Voe oil liftings down sharply in week.</title>
<headline>Sullom Voe oil liftings down sharply in week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Loadings of Brent crude from Britain's Sullom Voe terminal totalled 567,855 tonnes in the week to December 3, down sharply from the previous week's lifting of 799,265 tonnes, the Shetlands Islands Council Marine Operations said.</p>
<p>Shipments to northwest Europe slumped dramatically although sailing to the U.S did pick up.</p>
